  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training for customs officers under the EXBS programme - Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&#x160;kolenie pre coln&#xfa; spr&#xe1;vu Ukrajiny v r&#xe1;mci EXBS programu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Training organized in cooperation with the US Embassy in Slovakia and Tirana (EXBS programme) in Vysne Nemecke (Slovakia), aimed at improving the quality of service of the Ukrainian customs officers in the field of special technologies and cynology.&lt;br /&gt;The costs listed here represent the expenses of the Financial Administration of the Slovak Republic.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&#x160;kolenie organizovan&#xe9; v spolupr&#xe1;ci s Ve&#x13e;vyslanectvom USA v SR a v Tirane (program EXBS) vo Vy&#x161;nom Nemeckom (SR), s cie&#x13e;om zv&#xfd;&#x161;enia kvality v&#xfd;konu slu&#x17e;by ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch coln&#xed;kov v oblasti &#x161;peci&#xe1;lnych technol&#xf3;gi&#xed; a kynol&#xf3;gie.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Tu uveden&#xe9; n&#xe1;klady predstavuj&#xfa; v&#xfd;davky Finan&#x10d;nej spr&#xe1;vy SR.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org ref="XM-DAC-69-3" role="2" type="10">
